WEBVTT

00:07:27.818 --> 00:07:30.571
and I just want to put it here as well,

00:07:30.613 --> 00:07:32.907
in most countries --
not all, unfortunately,

00:07:32.907 --> 00:07:34.992
but in a lot of countries
around the world,

00:07:34.992 --> 00:07:38.954
we have a very solid legislative framework
for gender equality.

00:07:38.996 --> 00:07:40.331
We have commitments.

00:07:40.331 --> 00:07:42.625
But when it comes to budget and finance,

00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:45.753
that's where, suddenly,
the story evaporates.

00:07:46.128 --> 00:07:47.755
So when it comes to money,

00:07:47.796 --> 00:07:50.299
it's not really analyzed
for gender impact.

00:07:50.633 --> 00:07:52.051
So this is really important,

00:07:52.051 --> 00:07:55.054
and we do this in, as I said, three steps.

00:07:55.095 --> 00:07:58.098
I will take you very fast
through these steps, don't worry.

00:07:58.098 --> 00:08:02.102
So the first step is really
to do a situation analysis.